OL,3,GNEWSAFeud murder accused felt 'sick'
OL,4,Aover death
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man accused alongside his father and
OL,7,Fbrother of murdering a man in a feud
OL,8,Fhas told jurors he felt "physically
OL,9,Fsick" about the victim's death.
OL,11,FDaniel Ambler, 23, was killed by a car
OL,12,Fdriven by Ashton Anderson at a petrol
OL,13,Fstation in Seaham, County Durham, in
OL,14,FJanuary, after months of incidents
OL,15,Fbetween their families, Teesside Crown
OL,16,FCourt heard.
OL,18,FBarry Anderson, 52, and his sons
OL,19,FAshton, 20, and Logan, 19, deny murder,
OL,20,Fas do Tyler Leadbetter and Ajay Henry,
OL,21,Fboth 18, who were passengers in the
OL,22,Fcar.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
